@*
檔案整體說明

目的與定位：呈現 ChurchSettings Controller 依目前登入者授權教會載入的白名單詞彙、教會覆寫與預覽。
主要流程：Controller 先重新驗證管理員與 account scope，再把有限的純值模型交給本檢視；每個儲存或還原
表單都帶 antiforgery token，提交後回到伺服器重新授權。固定文字來自 ChurchSettingsText，動態欄位由
Razor 預設 HTML encoder 輸出，不使用 Html.Raw 或手工 JSON。
使用邊界與維護：本檢視不接受或輸出可授權教會的欄位，不保存 Session、快取、連線或背景工作。
表單值只在當次回應中存活，跨請求隔離由 Controller 與核心服務負責；修改後需以 ChurchReport 建置、
指定測試及檔案文件／CRLF 檢查驗證。
*@
@model ChurchTermsPageModel
<h1>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.TermsTitle")</h1>
<table class="table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Key")</th>
            <th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.SystemText")</th>
            <th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Culture")</th>
            <th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.ChurchOverride")</th>
            <th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Preview")</th>
            <th></th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    @foreach (var key in Model.Keys)
    {
        var row = Model.Overrides.FirstOrDefault(item => string.Equals(item.Key, key, StringComparison.Ordinal));
        <tr>
            <td>@key</td>
            <td>@(row?.SystemText ?? string.Empty)</td>
            <td>
                <form method="post" action="/ChurchSettings/Terms/Save">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                    <input type="hidden" name="key" value="@key" />
                    <input name="culture" value="@(row?.Culture ?? "zh-TW")" maxlength="16" />
                    <textarea name="text" maxlength="2000">@(row?.OverrideText ?? string.Empty)</textarea>
                    <button type="submit">@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Save")</button>
                </form>
            </td>
            <td>@(row?.OverrideText ?? string.Empty)</td>
            <td>@(row?.Preview ?? string.Empty)</td>
            <td>
                <form method="post" action="/ChurchSettings/Terms/Reset">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                    <input type="hidden" name="key" value="@key" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="culture" value="@(row?.Culture ?? "zh-TW")" />
                    <button type="submit">@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Reset")</button>
                </form>
            </td>
        </tr>
    }
    </tbody>
</table>
